        "text": "<p>Please note that the skin barrier and particularly the science of the skin microbiome are still poorly understood, especially in (outdoor) athletes, and requires a lot more research. At Freaks of Nature we are committed to contribute to this needed scientific work by conducting regular clinical trials with our research partner HelloBiome. But here are the key causes for outdoor athletes skin barrier to be compromised. These are also the key areas of focus which drive our current formulations and future product development pipeline.</p>",
